++    <h2>How it works</h2>
++    <p>Bacon's biliteral system hidden in the letter case of ordinary prose, so the message looks like innocent text.</p>
++    <p>Uppercase/lowercase of ordinary text encodes Bacon's five-bit letters.</p>
++
++    <h2>A worked example</h2>
++    <p>Plaintext:</p>
++    <pre><code>MEET ME BY THE OLD CLOCK TOWER AT DAWN</code></pre>
