++
++    <h2>How it is broken</h2>
++    <p>Given the alphabet it is Vigenere in disguise. Not given it, the alphabet has to be searched too — and a solver that assumes A = 0 recovers nothing at all, because the per-column shift it finds is a shift of the wrong alphabet.</p>
++
