+-### 6.1 The Clock 7 Universal Pivot
+-Across the entire suite, Clock 7 acts as the structural carrier bridge:
+-$$\text{PK8: } [4, 5, 6, \mathbf{7}] \;\longrightarrow\; \text{PK9: } [4, \mathbf{7}] \;\longrightarrow\; \text{PK10: } [\mathbf{7}, 8, 9]$$
