++        "breaking": "The strongest fractionation in this collection, and the hardest to "
++                    "attack from nothing: the 27-cell cube and the period have to be "
++                    "recovered together.",
++        "history": "Delastelle's last cipher, published posthumously in 1902.",
++    },
++    "m94": {
