+-   - *Key*: `MARGINS` (Column permutation: `[1, 3, 4, 0, 5, 2, 6]`).
+-   - *Plaintext*: References Pellegrin's treatise on textiles: *"un ago tanto sottile da leggere qualunque nodo"* (a needle so fine as to read any knot!).
