+        <li><a href="substitution-cipher-wiki.html">Simple substitution</a> — Every plaintext letter maps to a fixed ciphertext letter. Solved by quadgram hill climbing with restarts.</li>
+    </ul>
+    <h3>Transposition ciphers</h3>
+    <p>The letters are the plaintext's own, only reordered. Frequencies are untouched, so the attack is anagramming rather than statistics.</p>
